#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:36
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"&cirkuit; is an application to produce high-quality publication-ready "
"graphics. It provides a uniform interface to various graphics description "
"languages. As of today, the supported languages are Circuit Macros, TikZ, "
"PSTricks and Gnuplot."
msgstr ""
"&cirkuit; é un aplicativo para producir gráficos de alta calidade listos "
"para publicarse. Fornece unha interface uniforme para varias linguaxes de "
"descrición de gráficos. A día de hoxe, as linguaxes compatíbeis son os "
"macros de Circuit, TikZ, PSTricks e Gnuplot."

